  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aji de Gallina owes its colour and warmth to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "aji-amarillo"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Aji Amarillo "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", Peru's bright yellow-orange chilli. Here, red chilli and turmeric stand in for it, giving the same golden hue and gentle heat. The sauce is thickened with ground walnuts and cream, which gives it a distinctive richness."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Poach the chicken in stock and shred it by hand for the best texture. The poaching liquid becomes your sauce base, so do not discard it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
